cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "sqc: Superconducting Qubit Quantum Sensing Simulation Platform"
abstract: >-
  A QuTiP-based, full-stack simulation platform for time-dependent magnetic-field
  sensing with superconducting Transmon qubits, covering flux-to-frequency
  transduction, sensing protocols, waveform reconstruction, frequency calibration,
  and control-line predistortion.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-17"
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Zip"
keywords:
  - quantum sensing
  - superconducting qubit
  - transmon
  - cQED
  - qutip
  - waveform reconstruction
